{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a2e1f5e1222b67440a71336beaeeaf7f7a8cf852ce8e60d922eb8be06a19cc8e", "ja": "ああ、亜利沙専用、亜利沙のための衣装だ。\n可愛いところを、ちゃんと引き出すためのな！", "zh": "对，亚利沙专用，只为亚利沙制作的服装，\n为了完美衬托出你可爱的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0144_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "b5779c3f70b49845f0d01e87759167f93abc850dfd1924ff16c7754ca87de6d1", "ja": "かかか、カワイイだなんて！\nそんなことは……！", "zh": "竟竟竟、竟然说亚利沙可爱！\n才没有呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
